Problem Link:
https://leetcode.com/problems/minimum-number-of-pushes-to-type-word-i/?envType=daily-question&envId=2026-07-30

Solution:
class Solution {
public:
    int minimumPushes(string word) {
        int n = word.size();
        int m = 0;

        for(int i = 0; i < n; i++) 
        {
            m += (i / 8) + 1;
        }

        return m;
    }
};
